        { "host": "A", "text": "It's Thursday, November 19th, and this is The AI Edge, presented by Epilogue." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Epilogue is an AI venture studio and consultancy in Toronto, building products where the answer has to be right. Epilogue ships systems that know what they know, show their work, and fail visibly instead of quietly. Find out more at epiloguelabs.com." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "I'm Maya." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And I'm Alex." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Here's what moved at the frontier of AI over the last 24 hours, with every claim traced back to the source it came from." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "First, Anthropic priced its initial public offering at $83.00 per share, selling 980,000,000 Class A shares for $81.3 billion in proceeds." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Second, the US Government Accountability Office released covert testing in which prompts to Claude, Grok, ChatGPT and Gemini each produced an attack plan in under 12 hours." },
